st natural killer cell-mediated lysis (PubMed:17562706). May negatively regulate cell cycle and differentiation of melanocytes via inactivation of STAT3 (PubMed:34310951)"}], "commentType": "FUNCTION"}, {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "17562706"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "34310951"}], "value": "Homodimer. Interacts (via ITIM motif) with PTPN6 (PubMed:17562706). Interacts (via ITIM motif) with PTPN11; this interaction triggers dephosphorylation and activation of PTPN11 (PubMed:17562706, PubMed:34310951)"}], "commentType": "SUBUNIT"}, {"commentType": "INTERACTION", "interactions": [{"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q2HXU8-2", "intActId": "EBI-12811991"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q01638-2", "geneName": "IL1RL1", "intActId": "EBI-12838366"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q2HXU8-2", "intActId": "EBI-12811991"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q8N5M9", "geneName": "JAGN1", "intActId": "EBI-10266796"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q2HXU8-2", "intActId": "EBI-12811991"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q9UBY5", "geneName": "LPAR3", "intActId": "EBI-12033434"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q2HXU8-2", "intActId": "EBI-12811991"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q8N112", "geneName": "LSMEM2", "intActId": "EBI-10264855"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q2HXU8-2", "intActId": "EBI-12811991"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q13021", "geneName": "MALL", "intActId": "EBI-750078"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q2HXU8-2", "intActId": "EBI-12811991"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "P35372-10", "geneName